::kind(api)

::meta(crate: sisho-board-tui, dependencies: (sisho-board-core, sisho-board-health, sisho-board-run, sisho-board-sdk), dependents: (sisho-board))

=[sisho-board-tui]

Ratatui terminal interface and interactive event loop for `sisho-board`.

Two-tier design:

- @strong[Board]: Status of tools, extensions (with explicit user trust via `sisho`),

extension board panes (`--sisho-board-pane`), integrity check outcomes, and broken links.

- @strong[Counter]: Action prompt bar to run check, fix, check-links, manage extension trust, or launch TUI extensions.

==[Module screen]

Terminal guard: manages raw mode, alternate screen, and mouse capture.

===[Structs]

====[struct Screen]

Terminal guard: ensures terminal is restored to normal state even on panic or error.

===[Functions]

====[fn restore_terminal]

Restore the terminal to cooked mode and exit alternate screen. Safe to call multiple times.

==[Module ui]

Ratatui rendering for `sisho-board` using the shared `sisho-tui` shell.

===[Functions]

====[fn draw]

Render the complete `sisho-board` interface inside the shared `sisho-tui` shell.

==[Functions]

===[fn run]

Run the interactive board TUI in `dir`.

===[fn run_with_extensions]

Run the interactive board TUI in `dir` with pre-scanned `extensions`.

===[fn run_with_model]

Run the interactive board TUI with an initialized \[`Model`\].
